      "end_time": "2026-10-06T15:05:29.334000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "microphone"
      },
      "text": "I think part of me wants to do a quick spike, part of me thinks it's way overdue. Beacon is kind of the test case for the dashboard you know, cards, in my opinion. Yeah, my worry with the first-run experience experience is that um, we bike-shed it.",
      "start_time": "2026-10-06T15:05:29.343000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-10-06T15:05:45.343000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "microphone"
      },
      "text": "Yeah, yeah, the last time we touched the form validation it was basically done, at least for now.",
      "start_time": "2026-10-06T15:05:48.219000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-10-06T15:05:54.219000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "speaker",
        "name": "Sam Okafor"
      },
      "text": "Did anyone look at the process before this call? Okay yeah, I'd rather get more data than cut the scope, or whatever. So the handoff came up before this call too, if that makes sense. But the new folks keep asking about the first-run experience, in my opinion.",
      "start_time": "2026-10-06T15:05:54.235000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-10-06T15:06:10.235000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "microphone"
      },
      "text": "Yeah.",
      "start_time": "2026-10-06T15:06:10.314000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-10-06T15:06:10.914000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "microphone"
      },
      "text": "we lost three or four tries on the",
      "start_time": "2026-10-06T15:06:10.955000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-10-06T15:06:13.622000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "microphone"
      },
