      "end_time": "2026-10-06T15:06:29.835000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "microphone"
      },
      "text": "For what it's worth",
      "start_time": "2026-10-06T15:06:29.893000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-10-06T15:06:31.226000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "microphone"
      },
      "text": "I'd rather sanity check the assumptions than draw it on a whiteboard.",
      "start_time": "2026-10-06T15:06:31.685000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-10-06T15:06:35.685000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "microphone"
      },
      "text": "Actually, people on the other team mentioned the dashboard cards over the weekend, so it's on people's radar.",
      "start_time": "2026-10-06T15:06:35.749000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-10-06T15:06:41.749000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "speaker",
        "name": "Ruth Abebe"
      },
      "text": "There's a world where we draw it on a whiteboard and the filter bar just goes away",
