      "end_time": "2026-10-06T15:07:10.407000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "microphone"
      },
      "text": "when I looked at the type scale for the onboarding redesign",
      "start_time": "2026-10-06T15:07:11.384000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-10-06T15:07:15.051000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "microphone"
      },
      "text": "it's honestly fine.",
      "start_time": "2026-10-06T15:07:15.136000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-10-06T15:07:16.136000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "microphone"
      },
      "text": "Okay yeah, it feels like the motion specs and the spreadsheet are kind of the same problem.",
      "start_time": "2026-10-06T15:07:16.169000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-10-06T15:07:21.836000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "microphone"
      },
      "text": "So for Beacon, I think the communication plan the part that's unclear.",
      "start_time": "2026-10-06T15:07:21.876000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-10-06T15:07:25.876000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "microphone"
      },
      "text": "And",
      "start_time": "2026-10-06T15:07:31.236000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-10-06T15:07:31.836000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "microphone"
      },
      "text": "then there's a world where we",
      "start_time": "2026-10-06T15:07:41.031000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-10-06T15:07:43.031000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "microphone"
      },
      "text": "run it by support and the scope just goes away.",
      "start_time": "2026-10-06T15:07:43.516000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-10-06T15:07:46.849000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "speaker",
        "name": "Sam Okafor"
      },
      "text": "Usability results are in.",
      "start_time": "2026-10-06T15:07:46.875000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-10-06T15:07:48.208000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "speaker",
        "name": "Sam Okafor"
      },
      "text": "Completion went from fifty eight percent to seventy three percent with the three step flow.",
      "start_time": "2026-10-06T15:07:48.237000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-10-06T15:07:53.237000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "speaker",
        "name": "Elena Petrova"
      },
      "text": "Yeah, so the annoying thing about the type scale is it's a little behind...",
      "start_time": "2026-10-06T15:07:53.544000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-10-06T15:07:58.211000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "speaker",
        "name": "Elena Petrova"
      },
      "text": "Actually",
      "start_time": "2026-10-06T15:07:58.703000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-10-06T15:07:59.303000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "speaker",
        "name": "Elena Petrova"
      },
      "text": "did anyone look at the handoff over uh, the weekend?",
      "start_time": "2026-10-06T15:07:59.982000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-10-06T15:08:03.316000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "speaker",
        "name": "Elena Petrova"
      },
      "text": "I guess it's like, the component library is lower priority than we think and nobody wants too say it.",
      "start_time": "2026-10-06T15:08:03.380000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-10-06T15:08:09.714000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "speaker"
      },
      "text": "Anyway, the scope is weirdly controversial",
      "start_time": "2026-10-06T15:08:09.942000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-10-06T15:08:11.942000Z"
