    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "speaker",
        "name": "Elena Petrova"
      },
      "text": "but the action items is kind of mystery.",
      "start_time": "2026-10-06T15:08:11.956000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-10-06T15:08:14.623000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "speaker",
        "name": "Elena Petrova"
      },
      "text": "So there's a world where we do a proper write-up and the table density just goes away.",
