      "end_time": "2026-10-06T15:08:21.206000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "speaker",
        "name": "Elena Petrova"
      },
      "text": "Yeah, so I'd love to look at it with fresh eyes, but the design critique is way more complicated than it looks",
