      "end_time": "2026-10-06T15:08:28.853000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "speaker",
        "name": "Megan Liu"
      },
      "text": "Um, did anyone look at the button hierarchy a while back?",
      "start_time": "2026-10-06T15:08:29.492000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-10-06T15:08:33.158000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "speaker",
        "name": "Megan Liu"
      },
      "text": "Honestly the color tokens only needs twelve steps if we pair on it",
      "start_time": "2026-10-06T15:08:33.169000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-10-06T15:08:37.502000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "microphone"
      },
      "text": "Right, the backlog came up last night too and stuff. So I talked to the finance side about the empty state like and they were kind of lukewarm.",
      "start_time": "2026-10-06T15:08:37.554000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-10-06T15:08:46.887000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "speaker",
        "name": "Elena Petrova"
      },
      "text": "We've been saying we'd do it properly for a while, I think. And the type scale is the blocker.",
      "start_time": "2026-10-06T15:08:52.994000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-10-06T15:08:59.328000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "speaker",
        "name": "Lena Fischer"
      },
      "text": "Okay, so the form validation is a little behind, but the next steps is taking longer than expected.",
      "start_time": "2026-10-06T15:08:59.352000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-10-06T15:09:05.352000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "microphone"
      },
      "text": "Well, we've been saying we'd keep it behind a flag for a while, I think. Our solutions engineer mentioned the dashboard cards last night, so it's on people's radar. Yeah, the filter bar came up last week too. So that's basically what we saw with the component library on the onboarding redesign. So when I looked at the accessibility audit for Beacon, we're doing it two different ways. Part of me wants to do a quick spike, part of me thinks like it's weirdly controversial. Anyway, I'd rather map out the edge cases than draw like it on a whiteboard, but yeah.",
      "start_time": "2026-10-06T15:09:05.383000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-10-06T15:09:39.383000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "speaker"
      },
      "text": "It's like",
      "start_time": "2026-10-06T15:09:42.785000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-10-06T15:09:43.452000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "speaker"
      },
      "text": "the tradeoffs is the easy easy part and nobody wants to say it.",
      "start_time": "2026-10-06T15:09:44.375000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-10-06T15:09:48.709000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "microphone"
      },
      "text": "Oh, nice.",
      "start_time": "2026-10-06T15:09:47.379000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-10-06T15:09:47.979000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "speaker"
      },
      "text": "And.",
      "start_time": "2026-10-06T15:09:49.989000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-10-06T15:09:50.589000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "speaker",
        "name": "Megan Liu"
      },
      "text": "The way I see it, we've been saying we'd split it into two pieces for a while, but yeah. Which, there's a world where we check with legal and the motion specs just goes away",
      "start_time": "2026-10-06T15:09:51.789000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-10-06T15:10:03.456000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "microphone"
      },
      "text": "Honestly, I think the risk is that we lose context, honestly.",
      "start_time": "2026-10-06T15:10:03.483000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-10-06T15:10:07.150000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "microphone"
      },
      "text": "Well, the backlog came up earlier too, to be honest",
      "start_time": "2026-10-06T15:10:07.244000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-10-06T15:10:10.577000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "speaker",
        "name": "Sam Okafor"
      },
      "text": "I spent about 30 tickets on the mobile layout and it's mostly noise.",
      "start_time": "2026-10-06T15:10:10.624000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-10-06T15:10:14.958000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "speaker",
        "name": "Lena Fischer"
      },
      "text": "Okay, I talked to a few like managers about the dark mode pass and they were pretty chill about it. The design team keep asking about the empty state, right. Are we worried about the requirements? Yeah, like the design team mentioned the loading states on Friday, so it's on people's radar. And then the like thing I'd push on is the handoff to eng, write. Well, there's a world where we test it with a few users and the filter bar just goes away.",
