      "end_time": "2026-10-06T15:10:47.625000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "microphone"
      },
      "text": "Gotcha.",
      "start_time": "2026-10-06T15:10:47.827000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-10-06T15:10:48.427000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "speaker",
        "name": "Megan Liu"
      },
      "text": "To be fair",
      "start_time": "2026-10-06T15:10:48.506000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-10-06T15:10:49.506000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "speaker",
        "name": "Megan Liu"
      },
      "text": "we like said we'd simplify it and then the doc happened.",
      "start_time": "2026-10-06T15:10:49.553000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-10-06T15:10:53.220000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "speaker",
        "name": "Megan Liu"
      },
      "text": "Nice",
      "start_time": "2026-10-06T15:10:53.262000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-10-06T15:10:53.862000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "speaker",
        "name": "Megan Liu"
      },
      "text": "that's the flow I'm building so that's good to hear.",
      "start_time": "2026-10-06T15:10:53.958000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-10-06T15:10:57.292000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "speaker",
        "name": "Lena Fischer"
      },
      "text": "And can we we just ship the smaller version?",
      "start_time": "2026-10-06T15:10:57.633000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-10-06T15:11:00.633000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "speaker",
        "name": "Ruth Abebe"
      },
      "text": "From my side, nobody really owns the backlog right now, if that makes sense. So like if the like communication plan slips again, Beacon is going to feel it.",
      "start_time": "2026-10-06T15:11:01.617000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-10-06T15:11:11.284000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "speaker",
        "name": "Megan Liu"
      },
      "text": "Okay...",
      "start_time": "2026-10-06T15:11:11.372000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-10-06T15:11:11.972000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "speaker",
        "name": "Megan Liu"
      },
      "text": "Honestly, if the button hierarchy slips again, Beacon is going to feel it. um, But are we worried about open questions? So where are we on the mobile layout for Beacon? like I think the backlog took like 12 steps last time, I don't know. And we lost most of the afternoon on the empty state over the weekend. I'd rather pair on it than timebox it, anyway. And we said we'd start with the boring version and then the nav happened.",
      "start_time": "2026-10-06T15:11:11.973000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-10-06T15:11:39.306000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "speaker",
        "name": "Sam Okafor"
      },
      "text": "Yeah, I think we keep going back and forth on the communication plan.",
      "start_time": "2026-10-06T15:11:47.927000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-10-06T15:11:52.260000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "speaker",
        "name": "Sam Okafor"
      },
      "text": "Is it just me or",
      "start_time": "2026-10-06T15:11:53.204000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-10-06T15:11:54.870000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "speaker",
        "name": "Sam Okafor"
      },
      "text": "is the video lagging?",
      "start_time": "2026-10-06T15:11:54.917000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-10-06T15:11:56.250000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "microphone"
      },
      "text": "Yeah, so I think tradeoffs is a bit messy and the table density is still pretty rough, so maybe test it with a few users. And the last time we touched the type scale it was a known issue, I don't know.",
      "start_time": "2026-10-06T15:11:57.171000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-10-06T15:12:11.171000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "speaker",
        "name": "Ruth Abebe"
      },
      "text": "Oh, okay.",
      "start_time": "2026-10-06T15:12:07.541000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-10-06T15:12:08.141000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "speaker",
        "name": "Megan Liu"
      },
      "text": "uh,",
      "start_time": "2026-10-06T15:12:11.819000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-10-06T15:12:12.419000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "speaker",
        "name": "Megan Liu"
      },
      "text": "There's a world where we do a quick spike I mean,",
      "start_time": "2026-10-06T15:12:15.433000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-10-06T15:12:19.099000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "speaker",
        "name": "Megan Liu"
      },
      "text": "and the usability sessions just goes away.",
      "start_time": "2026-10-06T15:12:19.168000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-10-06T15:12:21.501000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "microphone"
      },
      "text": "Yeah",
      "start_time": "2026-10-06T15:12:21.553000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-10-06T15:12:22.153000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "microphone"
      },
      "text": "so that's basically what we saw with the next steps on the onboarding redesign.",
      "start_time": "2026-10-06T15:12:22.456000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-10-06T15:12:27.123000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "speaker",
        "name": "Lena Fischer"
      },
      "text": "I'd love to make it someone's job",
      "start_time": "2026-10-06T15:12:27.167000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-10-06T15:12:29.501000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "speaker",
        "name": "Lena Fischer"
      },
      "text": "but the spreadsheet is ahead of where I expected.",
      "start_time": "2026-10-06T15:12:29.599000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-10-06T15:12:32.599000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "speaker",
        "name": "Ruth Abebe"
      },
      "text": "Right.",
      "start_time": "2026-10-06T15:12:32.608000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-10-06T15:12:33.208000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "speaker",
        "name": "Ruth Abebe"
      },
      "text": "So for Beacon, I think the spacing is like the part that's in a weird spot. And then the onboarding redesign is kind of the test case for the mobile layout, in my opinion...",
      "start_time": "2026-10-06T15:12:33.245000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-10-06T15:12:44.578000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "microphone"
      },
      "text": "For what it's worth, I just want to make sure the color tokens doesn't fall through the cracks",
      "start_time": "2026-10-06T15:12:44.623000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-10-06T15:12:50.623000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "microphone"
      },
      "text": "So.",
      "start_time": "2026-10-06T15:12:51.412000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-10-06T15:12:52.012000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "microphone"
      },
      "text": "Actually, the empty state is fine for now, but the search results page is weirdly controversial.",
      "start_time": "2026-10-06T15:12:52.063000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-10-06T15:12:57.397000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "speaker",
        "name": "Lena Fischer"
      },
      "text": "Sure, yeah.",
      "start_time": "2026-10-06T15:12:56.184000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-10-06T15:12:56.784000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "microphone"
      },
      "text": "The component library is in good shape.",
      "start_time": "2026-10-06T15:12:57.425000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-10-06T15:12:59.759000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "microphone"
      },
      "text": "I think part of me wants to go back to the original plan",
      "start_time": "2026-10-06T15:13:00.021000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-10-06T15:13:04.355000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "microphone"
      },
      "text": "part of me thinks it's a little fragile.",
      "start_time": "2026-10-06T15:13:04.393000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-10-06T15:13:07.059000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "speaker",
        "name": "Lena Fischer"
      },
      "text": "Exactly.",
      "start_time": "2026-10-06T15:13:06.468000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-10-06T15:13:07.068000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "microphone"
      },
      "text": "But I'm not convinced the dashboard cards is unclear",
      "start_time": "2026-10-06T15:13:07.219000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-10-06T15:13:10.219000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "speaker",
        "name": "Elena Petrova"
      },
      "text": "Love that.",
      "start_time": "2026-10-06T15:13:09.511000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-10-06T15:13:10.111000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "microphone"
      },
      "text": "if that makes sense.",
      "start_time": "2026-10-06T15:13:10.740000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-10-06T15:13:12.073000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "microphone"
      },
      "text": "To be fair, the form validation came up yesterday too, anyway.",
      "start_time": "2026-10-06T15:13:12.142000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-10-06T15:13:15.809000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "microphone"
      },
      "text": "But part of me wants to start with the boring version, part of me thinks it's kind of a mystery.",
      "start_time": "2026-10-06T15:13:15.812000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-10-06T15:13:22.479000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "microphone"
      },
      "text": "Anyway",
      "start_time": "2026-10-06T15:13:24.420000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-10-06T15:13:25.020000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "microphone"
      },
      "text": "I'm cautiously like optimistic about the tooltip pattern, to be honest.",
      "start_time": "2026-10-06T15:13:25.098000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-10-06T15:13:28.765000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "speaker"
      },
      "text": "Look, when I looked at the first-run experience for the onboarding redesign, we're doing it two different ways.",
      "start_time": "2026-10-06T15:13:28.814000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-10-06T15:13:34.814000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "speaker",
        "name": "Lena Fischer"
      },
      "text": "Right,",
      "start_time": "2026-10-06T15:13:34.892000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-10-06T15:13:35.492000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "speaker"
      },
      "text": "and I'd rather do it properly than run it by support.",
      "start_time": "2026-10-06T15:13:37.270000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-10-06T15:13:40.936000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "speaker",
        "name": "Lena Fischer"
      },
      "text": "Cool, I'll let you all go.",
      "start_time": "2026-10-06T15:13:41.393000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-10-06T15:13:43.393000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "speaker",
        "name": "Lena Fischer"
      },
      "text": "Thanks.",
      "start_time": "2026-10-06T15:13:43.989000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-10-06T15:13:44.589000Z"
    }
  ]
